  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Shotguns</p>\n<p><em>For dramatic entrances or zeroing gonks through drywall via buckshot.</em></p>\n<p>When the weapon is fired at Cover (and only Cover) within 2m/yds, the Attack Check automatically succeeds, and all damage the Cover (and only the cover) suffers from the Attack is doubled (x2). If a Shotgun Shell was fired as part of this Attack, then it also functions as an Explosive for the purposes of carrying damage to targets behind Cover destroyed by the Attack. Incompatible with any other muzzle-based attachment.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Barrels &amp; Muzzles).</em></p>"
